  "answer": "For a Growth customer paying annually, the combined calculation is as follows:\n\n- **Base monthly price**: $3,600 per month [NL-003#NL-003-S02].\n- **Annual base subscription fee** (before discount): $3,600 × 12 = $43,200.\n- **Applicable prepayment discount**: 10% on the base subscription fee for annual pre-payment [NL-003#NL-003-S07]. Discount amount = $43,200 × 10% = $4,320.\n- **Discounted annual base subscription fee**: $43,200 − $4,320 = $38,880.\n- **One-time onboarding fee**: $7,500 (Growth tier) [NL-003#NL-003-S02] [NL-003#NL-003-S04]. This fee is not subject to the prepayment discount and is excluded from monthly recurring revenue.\n- **Total combined first-year cost** (discounted base + onboarding): $38,880 + $7,500 = **$46,380**.\n\nThe one-time onboarding fee is treated as a separate upfront charge, not as monthly recurring revenue; the effective monthly recurring revenue for the base subscription is $38,880 ÷ 12 = **$3,240/month**.\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer\nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
